- All prohibitions apply in full to any reworked, forked, or derivative versions.
- Obtaining permission to modify the code does not grant the right to monetize it.
- Permissions granted individually by the author are personal, non-transferable, and may be revoked upon violation of these terms.
- Automatic Termination. Upon violation of any condition, the rights granted under this license terminate automatically and immediately. With respect to the software code, rights may be reinstated upon curing the violation solely at the author's discretion; with respect to materials covered by CC BY-NC-ND 4.0, reinstatement follows Section 6(b) of that license.
- Versioning. The author reserves the right to modify the terms for future versions of the project. Previously released versions remain governed by the terms under which they were published; rights granted under CC BY-NC-ND 4.0 are irrevocable within the scope of that license.
- Severability. If any provision of this license is found to be unenforceable, the remaining provisions shall remain in full force and effect.

